!Sample_data_processing = Picard tools v.1.114 used mark duplicate reads, add read group info, and reorder BAMs.
!Sample_data_processing = BAMs are indexed using samtools v.0.1.19
!Sample_data_processing = FeatureCounts from Subread v.1.5.3 was used to quantify gene transcripts and generate raw counts file
!Sample_data_processing = EdgeR v.3.30.3 was used to normalize read counts and obtain CPM and RPKM values.
!Sample_data_processing = CPM values were used to filter the gene list  down to the 12,887 genes with average log2CPM >0.1 across all samples. RPKM values were converted into TPM values.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19/GRCh37
